          "prompt": "A line has gradient $4$ and passes through the point $(-1,3)$.\nFind its equation $y=mx+c$.",
          "answerSpaceMm": 32,
          "answer": {
           "short": "$y=4x+7$",
           "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=4x+c\\\\3&=4(-1)+c\\\\3&=-4+c\\\\3\\color{#ef6068}{+4}&=-4+c\\color{#ef6068}{+4}\\\\c&=7\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore $y=4x+7$."
